  "description": "TARPUB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C148 H140 Dy12 N24 O62 4+,2(H2 O1),4(C2 H3 O2 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy9 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy10 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy11 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy12 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.527-4.169 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.28-119.16°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C156H144Dy12N24O72.",
